From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mihawk <163614687+mihawk-99@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 07:20:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] radv/ps5: report what the GPU can do, and nothing it cannot

From mihawk-99/PS5_Mesa, squashed:

  901ee809730 aco: buffer scratch where a shader cannot set FLAT_SCRATCH
  5d0f65af185 radv/ps5: no performance queries
  7e587278c7a radv: ray tracing pipelines need flat scratch
  658fabdd62f radv/ps5: no ray tracing until acceleration structure builds run
  48a0444f3da radv/ps5: no fragment shader barycentrics on GFX10.1's parameter cache
  4acfcbe3822 radv/ps5: addrlib gets GFX1013's revision, with the depth mipmap fix
  234e9ff5f47 radv/ps5: compute waves find their subgroup ID in the ordered wave ID
  e307009aeb4 radv: report fragment shading rate only where the rasterizer has VRS
  ad8458e373d radv: report capture and replay only where a buffer can be placed
  62f2b6006fd radv: count only the representations there are; never read a missing one
  458250f1abd radv: export a VS's implicit primitive ID per primitive only where NGG can
  f7f32dc2905 radv: rebuild ray traversal node addresses by sign extension
---
